  "WEAPON_PART_C_KNIVES_1_UPGRADED": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, añade 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> y <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>aflige</link></style> al enemigo.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, add 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> and <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>afflict</link></style> the enemy.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, ajoutez 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> et <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>accablez</link></style> l’Ennemi.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, aggiungi 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> e affliggi il nemico.\"", "pt": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : durante seu ataque, some 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> e deixe o inimigo atormentado.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_KNIVES_2": {"es": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, después de que gastes un <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, añade 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "en": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, after you spend a <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, add 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "fr": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Après avoir dépensé une <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style> pendant votre attaque, ajoutez 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "it": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, dopo che hai speso un <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, aggiungi 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "pt": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: durante seu ataque, depois de gastar um <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, some 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_KNIVES_2_UPGRADED": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, después de que gastes un <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, añade 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, after you spend a <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, add 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Après avoir dépensé une <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style> pendant votre attaque, ajoutez 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, dopo che hai speso un <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, aggiungi 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\"", "pt": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: durante seu ataque, depois de gastar um <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>, some 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_KNIVES_3": {"es": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, si tienes 3 o más <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>, <style=Term><link=TERM_SLOWED>ralentiza</link></style> al enemigo\"", "en": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, if you have 3 or more <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>, <style=Term><link=TERM_SLOWED>slow</link></style> the enemy\"", "fr": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Si vous obtenez au moins 3 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> pendant votre attaque, <style=Term><link=TERM_SLOWED>ralentissez</link></style> l’Ennemi.\"", "it": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, se possiedi 3 o più <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>, rallenta il nemico.\"", "pt": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: durante seu ataque, se tiver 3 ou mais <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style>, deixe o inimigo atrasado.\""},
