  "WEAPON_PART_B_WAND_3": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>aflige</link></style> al enemigo y a cada enemigo adyacente a él.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>afflict</link></style> the enemy and each enemy adjacent to it.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>accablez</link></style> l’Ennemi et chaque Ennemi adjacent à lui.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, affliggi il nemico e ogni nemico adiacente ad esso.\"", "pt": "\"1 ]FAT]: durante seu ataque, deixe atormentado o inimigo e cada inimigo adjacente a ele.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_B_WAND_3_UPGRADED": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>aflige</link></style> y <style=Term><link=TERM_DOOMED>condena</link></style> al enemigo y a cada enemigo que esté a 2 o menos casillas de él.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>afflict</link></style> and <style=Term><link=TERM_DOOMED>doom</link></style> the enemy and each other enemy within 2 spaces of it.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>accablez</link></style> et <style=Term><link=TERM_DOOMED>damnez</link></style> l’Ennemi et chaque autre Ennemi dans un rayon de 2 cases autour de lui.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, affliggi e opprimi il nemico e ogni altro nemico entro 2 caselle da esso.\"", "pt": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: durante seu ataque, deixe atormentado e condenado o inimigo e cada inimigo a até 2 espaços dele.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_WAND_1": {"es": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Después de tu ataque, un héroe puede realizar <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>Desplazamiento</link></style> 2.\"", "en": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: After your attack, a hero may <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>shift</link></style> 2.\"", "fr": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Après votre attaque, un Héros peut <b><style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>Glisser</link></style> de 2</b>.\"", "it": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Dopo il tuo attacco, un eroe può <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>scattare</link></style> 2.\"", "pt": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: depois do seu ataque, um herói pode <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>deslocar</link></style> 2.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_WAND_1_UPGRADED": {"es": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Después de tu ataque, un héroe puede realizar <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>Desplazamiento</link></style> 3.\"", "en": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: After your attack, a hero may <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>shift</link></style> 3.\"", "fr": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Après votre attaque, un Héros peut <b><style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>Glisser</link></style> de 3</b>.\"", "it": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Dopo il tuo attacco, un eroe può <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>scattare</link></style> 3.\"", "pt": "\"2 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: depois do seu ataque, um herói pode <style=Term><link=TERM_SHIFT>deslocar</link></style> 3.\""},
  "WEAPON_PART_C_WAND_2": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, convierte 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_ADVANTAGE></link></style> en 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> y 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, convert 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_ADVANTAGE></link></style> to 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> and 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, convertissez 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_ADVANTAGE></link></style> en 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> et 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, converti 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_ADVANTAGE></link></style> in 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> e 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>.\"", "pt": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: durante o seu ataque, converta 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_ADVANTAGE></link></style> em 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> e 1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>.\""},
