  "WEAPON_PART_C_WAND_3": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>aflige</link></style> al enemigo y a cada enemigo adyacente a él.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: During your attack, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>afflict</link></style> the enemy and each enemy adjacent to it.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, <style=Term><link=TERM_AFFLICTED>accablez</link></style> l’Ennemi et chaque Ennemi adjacent à lui.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_FATIGUE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, affliggi il nemico e ogni nemico adiacente ad esso.\"", "pt": "\"1 ]FAT]: durante seu ataque, deixe atormentado o inimigo e cada inimigo adjacente a ele.\""},
