  "WEAPON_PART_A_WARBELL_1": {"es": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>: Durante tu ataque, añade 2 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> y <style=Term><link=TERM_EXPOSED>expón</link></style> al enemigo.\"", "en": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>: During your attack, add 2 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> and <style=Term><link=TERM_EXPOSED>expose</link></style> the enemy.\"", "fr": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style> : Pendant votre attaque, ajoutez 2 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> et <style=Term><link=TERM_EXPOSED>exposez</link></style> l’Ennemi.\"", "it": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>: Durante il tuo attacco, aggiungi 2 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> ed esponi il nemico.\"", "pt": "\"1 <style=Term><link=TERM_SURGE></link></style>: durante seu ataque, some 2 <style=Term><link=TERM_SUCCESS></link></style> e deixe o inimigo exposto.\""},
